# Runtime artifacts — regenerable trained models, embeddings, downloads.
# Resolved by hakase_kernel.runtime.paths.cache_dir(). Never commit these; the
# tracked counterparts live in assets/calibration/ (versioned build artifacts)
# and platform/structure/fixtures/ (reference structures).
/var/

